    "body": "The selected-record consumer cannot realize canonical protocol-2 answers through the frozen parent mixture: raw source BPE omits the first reply tokens, and unsupported punctuation remains outranked. This continuation adds a label-free exact-byte source emission view and a learned native Copy/Period/Stop realizer. Its numerical generation path uses q4 H4 context, geometric occurrence potentials and integer score/mass reduction without parent scores, forced copy position, scripted punctuation or forced EOS.\n\nOne fixed64-update/B8 offline Rust fit changes all four packed coefficient payloads. Reloaded native own-prefix generation improves0→4/20 complete exposed-development replies, with EOS20/20. All four wins repeat the same dancer input; suffix repetition, scrambled pieces and premature Stop remain. Independent saved-row review checks96 generated steps across five distinct numerical inputs and finds no exact observed-state repeat. This is a bounded source-realization result, not general chat, heldout quality, complete product serving or a geometry advantage.\n\nValidation: eight source-view/action tests and two realizer loss/artifact tests pass at frozen source ab4d3d7af45c8da5e1d967ee86abd19e1caaaddf. Actual construction and fit use executable SHA256803775353679cb116d169654522a07591c58944dcc7f21590b04838211253be3; independent exported reload is exact. Construction takes15.804s; fit380.667s monitored time, maximum RSS2,453,618,688B. Rustfmt, diff whitespace and claim wording checks pass. Fresh main is merged; numerical mechanism files are unchanged from that executed source. No integrated-head rebuild, GPU execution, hosted research run or shared-session integration is claimed. The research loader validates floating training shadows offline; the declared biased adjoint is not the derivative of integer rounding.\n\nThe current state, roadmap and bound evidence retain every row, negative attempt and complete3.5-hour estimated resource charge. Next is one frozen-final-artifact correct-prefix versus own-prefix ranking/input audit before another fit. No unchanged dose or preselected progress register is admitted. GitHub runners are excluded from research compute under owner direction.\n\nThis is the coherent successor to unmerged construction PR #1652 and includes its changes; retain that PR as historical evidence rather than merging both independently. References #1552, #1512, #820, #1652. Shared stack_grounded_session.rs is untouched.\n",
